)

#mcq(34, [Which of these stems is a scene question?],
  [What has just happened when the handkerchief is called a handkerchief?],
  [The play is set in Jacassa.],
  [The novel has three books.],
  [Othello was written by Shakespeare.]
)

#mcq(35, [Two options that seem to mean the same thing are usually separated by],
